      "side": 1,
      "message": "If a battery triggers internal cutoff, VSYS is lost (and EC is no longer in hibernation). Upon AC plug-in, pp3300 and pp1800 come up at the same time. PP1800 would be sustained by VBUS (not VBAT) so BGATE won\u0027t affect pp1800.",
